  aciklama:
  - "Fal\u0131n\u0131n en heyecanl\u0131 yerinde {{kelime, bir de Tarot kart\u0131
    \xE7ekelim mi | bir Tarot kart\u0131 \xE7ekip ne \xE7\u0131kaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    da g\xF6relim mi | senin ad\u0131na bir de Tarot kart\u0131 \xE7ekmemi ister
    misin | senin i\xE7in bir de Tarot kart\u0131 \xE7ekmemi ister misin | senin
    ad\u0131na Tarot destesinden bir de kart \xE7ekmemi ister misin | senin i\xE7in
    Tarot destesinden bir de kart \xE7ekmemi arzu eder misin}} {{isim}}? \U0001F642
    {{kelime, Dur bakal\u0131m ne \xE7\u0131kacak; | Bakal\u0131m ne \xE7\u0131kacak;
    | G\xF6relim bakal\u0131m ne \xE7\u0131kacak; | Bakal\u0131m baht\u0131na ne
    \xE7\u0131kacak; | Bakal\u0131m \u015Fans\u0131na ne \xE7\u0131kacak; | Bakal\u0131m
    \u015Fans\u0131na hangisi \xE7\u0131kacak; | Dur bakal\u0131m \u015Fans\u0131na
    hangisi \xE7\u0131kacak;}} {{kelime, \"Deli\" diye de ge\xE7en ve B\xFCy\xFCk
    Arkana kart\u0131 olan \"Budala\", senin i\xE7in d\xFCz a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131.
    A\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda \xF6n\xFCne pek \xE7ok se\xE7enek \xE7\u0131kaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6steriyor! | \"Deli\" diye de ge\xE7en B\xFCy\xFCk Arkana kart\u0131 olan
    \"Budala\", senin i\xE7in ters a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. A\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda \xF6n\xFCne
    birden fazla se\xE7enek \xE7\u0131kaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve karars\u0131z kalaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    i\u015Faret ediyor! | \"Aziz\" kart\u0131 senin i\xE7in d\xFCz a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131.
    Senden ya\u015F\xE7a b\xFCy\xFCk birinin, a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda seni do\u011Fru
    ki\u015Fiye y\xF6nlendirece\u011Fini i\u015Faret ediyor! | \"Aziz\" kart\u0131
    senin i\xE7in ters a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. A\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda eski kafal\u0131
    insanlar\u0131 dinlemeyece\u011Fini, ya\u015Fam tarz\u0131yla ya da g\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015F\xFCyle
    farkl\u0131 olan bir insanla beraber olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor!
    | \"Y\u0131ld\u0131z\" isimli B\xFCy\xFCk Arkana kart\u0131, senin i\xE7in d\xFCz
    a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. A\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda birlikte olmay\u0131 \xE7ok isteyece\u011Fin,
    hatta u\u011Fruna g\xF6zya\u015F\u0131 d\xF6kebilece\u011Fin biriyle beraber
    olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve onda huzur bulaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret
    ediyor! | \"Y\u0131ld\u0131z\" isimli B\xFCy\xFCk Arkana kart\u0131, senin i\xE7in
    ters a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. A\u015Fk hayat\u0131ndaki k\xF6t\xFCmserli\u011Finin
    seni ge\xE7mi\u015Fe tutsak etti\u011Fini ve gelece\u011Fe odaklanman durumunda
    \xE7ok mutlu olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor!}} \U0001F609 {{kelime,
    Hadi telvelerinle devam edelim; | Gel fincan\u0131ndan devam edelim; | Vard\u0131r
    bir bildi\u011Fi... Haydi fal\u0131na devam edelim; | Hay\u0131rl\u0131s\u0131
    bakal\u0131m. Gel fincan\u0131ndan devam edelim; | \u0130lgin\xE7. Biz bildi\u011Fimiz
    yoldan \u015Fa\u015Fmayal\u0131m, gel telvelerinle devam edelim; | Enteresan...
    Gel fal\u0131na devam edelim;}}"
